{"title":"Privatize Federal Land!","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/920909321/0/marginalrevolution~Privatize-Federal-Land.html","date":1751195803000,"content":"<p>I’ve <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/?s=sell+federal+land\">long advocated</a> selling off some federal land—an idea that reliably causes mass fainting spells among the enlightened. <em>How could we possibly part with our national patrimony, our land, our sacred wilderness?</em> Calm down. Most of this “public land” is never used by the public. Selling some of it would actually make it more accessible and useful to real people.</p>\r\n<p>Moreover, most of you wailing about selling some Federal land are probably very happy we sold the “public” airwaves for your private cell phone use. <em>Privatizing the airwaves made them much more useful to the public</em>. (Thank you Reed!).</p>\r\n<p>AEI has an <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.aei.org/research-products/report/senator-lee-bill-analysis/\">excellent map</a> of the lands that could be sold and developed in the Mike Lee <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.energy.senate.gov/services/files/DF7B7FBE-9866-4B69-8ACA-C661A4F18096\">bill</a>. Here’s their conclusion:</p>\r\n<blockquote><p>The data show a significant opportunity. Our analysis finds that developing just 135-180 square miles of the most suitable BLM land, a minuscule fraction of the total, could yield approximately 1 million new homes over ten years. This would substantially address the West’s housing shortage while generating an estimated $15 billion for the U.S. Treasury from land sales.</p></blockquote>\r\n<p>Here’s an example of the some of the land potentially developable around Las Vegas.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/MapLV-1024x799.png\" width=\"796\" height=\"621\" srcset=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/MapLV-1024x799.png 1024w, https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/MapLV-300x234.png 300w, https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/MapLV-768x599.png 768w, https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/MapLV.png 1120w\" /></p>\r\n<p>Here’s a Google satellite image of the bit around Mountain’s Edge. Enjoy your fishing on these public lands!</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/MapLV2-1024x802.png\" width=\"798\" height=\"625\" srcset=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/MapLV2-1024x802.png 1024w, https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/MapLV2-300x235.png 300w, https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/MapLV2-768x601.png 768w, https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/MapLV2.png 1120w\" /></p>\r\n<p>And here’s a very crude but useful scatter plot showing the correlation between median home prices in a state and Federal land ownership. Should home prices in Utah (63.1% Federally owned) really be 71% higher than in Texas (1.8% Federally owned)? Of course, Texas is famously an urban hellscape with no parks, no open space, and nowhere to hunt or fish.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/MedianPricesFedOwnership-1024x683.png\" width=\"865\" height=\"577\" srcset=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/MedianPricesFedOwnership-1024x683.png 1024w, https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/MedianPricesFedOwnership-300x200.png 300w, https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/MedianPricesFedOwnership-768x512.png 768w, https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/MedianPricesFedOwnership-1536x1024.png 1536w, https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/MedianPricesFedOwnership-2048x1365.png 2048w\" /></p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/06/privatize-federal-land.html\">Privatize Federal Land!</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/920909321/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/920909321/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/920909321/marginalrevolution,https%3a%2f%2fmarginalrevolution.com%2fwp-content%2fuploads%2f2025%2f06%2fMapLV-1024x799.png\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/920909321/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/920909321/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/20/920909321/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/rss20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/06/privatize-federal-land.html#comments\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/comments20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/06/privatize-federal-land.html/feed\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/commentsrss20.png\" /></a> \r\n<div><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/06/privatize-federal-land.html#comments\"><h3>Comments</h3></a><ul><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/06/privatize-federal-land.html#comment-160934196\">In reply to Jonathan Ray.   Please be serious. Food has to be ...</a> <i>by Wayfaring Stranger</i></li><li><a href=\"htt